                                "sense_id": "8872acd6-861b-395c-a6a7-871bd9d99617",
                                "text": "L'augment syllabique consiste en l’addition d’une syllabe ; l'augment temporel, dans le changement d’une brève en longue.",
                                "translation": "Syllabic augment consists of the addition of a syllable; temporal augment in changing it from short to long.",
